---
import DetailHeading from '../detailHeading.astro';
---
<div class="space-y-6 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
  <section>
    <DetailHeading>Product surface</DetailHeading>
    <p class="mt-4">
      The live application focuses on recipe management: users can create, edit, store and search recipes, with support for images, nutrition information, favorites and ratings. Profiles and an admin area cover the account and moderation surface described by the project evidence.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <DetailHeading>Implementation</DetailHeading>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
      <li><span class="font-bold text-slate-300">Angular 18.2.7:</span> provides the responsive client, recipe views, filters and English/Polish language switching.</li>
      <li><span class="font-bold text-slate-300">Spring Boot 3.4.1:</span> exposes the REST API for recipes, users and related operations.</li>
      <li><span class="font-bold text-slate-300">PostgreSQL:</span> persists the application data behind the API.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <DetailHeading>Scope boundary</DetailHeading>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Cibaria's source repository is private. This page therefore describes the shipped product and the checked project evidence without presenting private implementation files as public source.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
